proton-autogen (2.5.7) noble; urgency=medium

  * New Profil

  * Improve "add" system (major evolution)
    - Interactive prefix selection (reuse / create / switch easily)
    - Auto-detection of existing prefixes per game
    - Support multiple prefix targets (main, custom, shared, etc.)
    - Game binding stored in JSON config (~/.config/proton-autogen/games/)
    - Safer workflow: confirmation before overwriting/reusing prefixes
    - Better integration with Proton profiles (dx9, dx11, etc.)
    - Automatic mapping between executable and execution profile

  * Add Verbose option
    - proton-autogen app.exe --verbose      Verbose output

  * Add game support mangohud 32 Bit:
    - New profil Dx9 - Dx9 OpenGL
    - Mangohud 32 Bit compatibility

  * Add game support:
    - Need for Speed, RPG titles, and more.

  * New utilities:
    - proton-autogen --help-env (new in v2.5.3) for PRO users (EN/FR support)

  * Patch:
    - proton-autogen --json-profile:
      export all profile environment variables in JSON format
    - proton-autogen --profile dx11:
      apply the selected profile type

  * User profile system (Pro mode):
    - JSON profiles stored in ~/.config/proton-autogen/profiles/
    - Allows per-game environment customization

  * --profile <name> option:
    - Loads and applies a user-defined profile at runtime
    - Safely overrides environment variables

